<title>USA: FINA group buys 14 Eagle Mart shops.</title>
<headline>FINA group buys 14 Eagle Mart shops.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>FINA Oil and Chemical Co, the operating subsidiary of FINA Inc, said Tuesday that it and Southwest Convenience Stores LLC have purchase 14 Eagle Mart stores in Wichita Falls, Texas.</p>
<p>The Eagle Mart stores will be renamed FINA/7 Eleven stores, FINA Oil said. Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Southwest Convenience Stores operates 149 7-Eleven locations in West Texas and New Mexico.</p>
</text>
